    "Low contrast — dark text without a box or outline can be hard to read." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Geringer Kontrast: Dunkler Text ohne Box oder Kontur kann schwer lesbar sein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contraste bajo: el texto oscuro sin caja ni contorno puede ser difícil de leer."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Contraste faible : un texte sombre sans cadre ni contour peut être difficile à lire."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コントラストが低いです。ボックスや輪郭のない暗い文字は読みにくい場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对比度低：没有底框或描边的深色文字可能难以阅读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lower Third" : {
      "comment" : "Subtitle position",
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Lower bitrates make a smaller copy of the chosen version. The server prepares it first, which can take longer. Sizes are estimates." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Lower music and effects so voices are easier to hear." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Senkt Musik und Effekte ab, damit Stimmen besser zu hören sind."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Baja la música y los efectos para oír mejor las voces."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
